WEBVTT

00:01:03.603 --> 00:01:04.297
Are you all right?!

00:01:25.191 --> 00:01:26.715
What are they, immortal?

00:02:05.899 --> 00:02:08.299
This is bad. Get away from here!

00:02:28.254 --> 00:02:30.688
Giant Sand Burial!

00:02:36.095 --> 00:02:37.892
You're late, Gaara.

00:02:43.336 --> 00:02:44.997
Who are these guys?

00:02:45.405 --> 00:02:46.463
I don't know.

00:02:46.506 --> 00:02:49.236
They just came out of the sea
when we set up camp for the night.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:04.722
I'm not letting you get away!

00:03:04.991 --> 00:03:06.618
Stop! Don't go after them!

00:03:29.749 --> 00:03:34.152
We're at a complete disadvantage
at sea in the dark.

00:03:34.187 --> 00:03:35.484
Release the light balls!

00:03:35.822 --> 00:03:36.720
Yes!

00:03:50.069 --> 00:03:51.093
What is that?

00:03:51.638 --> 00:03:53.731
I've never seen
a boat like that before.

00:03:59.913 --> 00:04:00.777
This is bad!

00:05:25.231 --> 00:05:26.926
All right, go, go!

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:30.227
Hey! This is important.
Be quiet!

00:05:30.603 --> 00:05:31.365
Honestly...

00:05:46.953 --> 00:05:47.817
He went in!

00:05:48.521 --> 00:05:49.215
We did it!

00:06:03.836 --> 00:06:05.633
There, there. That's a good boy.

00:06:05.671 --> 00:06:07.730
He has black fur on his back legs.

00:06:08.107 --> 00:06:09.972
All right, it's him.

00:06:10.877 --> 00:06:11.866
Naruto, the cage!

00:06:14.781 --> 00:06:18.649
He's so stupid...
falling for such a stupid trap!

00:06:20.019 --> 00:06:20.883
Huh?

00:06:21.854 --> 00:06:22.718
What is it?

00:06:22.755 --> 00:06:24.950
Hey, Naruto! What did you do?!

00:06:25.124 --> 00:06:26.591
What did I do?
I just got the cage...

00:06:28.127 --> 00:06:29.389
Oww!

00:06:30.296 --> 00:06:31.888
You idiot!
Don't let him get away, Naruto!

00:06:31.931 --> 00:06:33.694
I'll beat you if he gets away!

00:06:45.845 --> 00:06:47.142
You idiot!

00:07:03.029 --> 00:07:05.930
Geez. I don't know why someone
would bother paying us

00:07:05.965 --> 00:07:09.332
to look for this vicious cat.

00:07:09.735 --> 00:07:11.327
Well, don't sulk like that.

00:07:11.571 --> 00:07:16.133
Our mission is to ﬁnd him
and deliver him to his owner.

00:07:16.342 --> 00:07:19.641
And he's not a cat. He's a ferret.

00:07:22.014 --> 00:07:24.278
Looking closely at him,
he's pretty cute.

00:07:24.517 --> 00:07:27.611
Anyway, let’s deliver him
and get back to the village.

00:07:33.426 --> 00:07:35.519
If we cross that bridge...

00:07:35.761 --> 00:07:36.625
All right!

00:07:36.662 --> 00:07:37.959
Hey, Naruto, wait!

00:07:38.097 --> 00:07:40.122
Let's get this mission over with—!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.544
What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:07:52.778 --> 00:07:55.212
It's says there that
this bridge is dangerous!

00:07:55.248 --> 00:07:56.579
I don't care about you,

00:07:56.682 --> 00:07:59.378
but what would we do
if something happened to the ferret?!

00:08:00.086 --> 00:08:02.247
Sakura, that's so mean.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:05.422
Shikamaru?

00:08:06.526 --> 00:08:07.515
What's wrong?

00:08:15.468 --> 00:08:17.698
Don't you think it seems
kind of strange?

00:08:18.171 --> 00:08:19.433
Strange?

00:08:20.139 --> 00:08:23.700
It's noon, but it doesn't look
like anyone's there.

00:08:24.076 --> 00:08:25.270
Come to think of it...

00:08:25.545 --> 00:08:27.308
You think so?

00:08:38.024 --> 00:08:40.015
Let's adopt scouting tactics
from here.

00:08:40.259 --> 00:08:42.159
I'll head around to the forest
on the west.

00:08:42.195 --> 00:08:44.493
Naruto and Sakura,
you head to the opposite side.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.519
— Roger!
— Roger!

00:08:46.566 --> 00:08:49.091
I hope this won't be a hassle...

00:09:03.316 --> 00:09:04.749
It's beyond that forest.

00:09:07.053 --> 00:09:08.816
Hey! Be quiet!

00:09:09.522 --> 00:09:10.921
I wonder what's come over him?

00:09:22.735 --> 00:09:23.463
What's this?

00:09:26.973 --> 00:09:27.632
Hey...

00:09:28.774 --> 00:09:29.866
Hey! What's wrong?!

00:09:39.485 --> 00:09:40.850
Who are you guys?!

00:09:49.362 --> 00:09:50.124
Naruto!

00:09:53.032 --> 00:09:54.465
There are some strange people...

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:55.398
I'm heading there now.

00:10:03.976 --> 00:10:04.965
What are they?

00:10:22.561 --> 00:10:23.755
All right!

00:10:37.476 --> 00:10:40.036
U...Zu...Ma...Ki!

00:10:41.781 --> 00:10:43.271
Naruto Barrage!

00:11:23.356 --> 00:11:25.187
So you're the leader!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:31.558
Why you...!

00:12:39.231 --> 00:12:40.198
Sakura!

00:12:45.004 --> 00:12:46.232
Naruto!

00:12:46.839 --> 00:12:48.773
Let go of me! Hey!

00:12:48.908 --> 00:12:50.170
Crap...

00:12:50.209 --> 00:12:52.177
Taking hostages is cowardly!

00:12:53.479 --> 00:12:55.674
Let go of her right now!

00:13:13.732 --> 00:13:15.131
Shadow Possession Jutsu...

00:13:19.205 --> 00:13:21.002
Naruto! Leave these guys to me!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:21.802
All right!

00:13:22.141 --> 00:13:24.666
I don't care who you guys are!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.405
I'm going to take care of you
all at once.

00:13:26.812 --> 00:13:28.973
Multi Shadow Clone!

00:13:42.461 --> 00:13:43.485
Here I go!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:12.782
Rasengan!

00:14:13.058 --> 00:14:14.491
Rising Thunder!

00:14:32.978 --> 00:14:34.104
Naruto!

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.720
Crap...

00:14:49.428 --> 00:14:50.395
Naruto...

00:14:53.599 --> 00:14:54.827
Sakura! This way!

00:15:16.055 --> 00:15:17.386
What is that?

00:16:06.071 --> 00:16:06.901
Oww!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.988
Now that you're up,
try not to move too much...

00:16:33.966 --> 00:16:37.424
I didn't think that you'd wake up
for another two or three days, but...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.667
Who are you, Gramps?

00:16:39.872 --> 00:16:44.935
Me? I'm Kahiko,
the elder of this caravan.

00:16:44.977 --> 00:16:45.875
Caravan?

00:16:45.944 --> 00:16:46.968
That's right.

00:16:47.012 --> 00:16:51.676
The people of the villages
call us the wandering people.

00:16:51.984 --> 00:16:56.785
We travel all over the place,
depending on the season.

00:16:56.889 --> 00:16:57.821
Oh?

00:16:57.856 --> 00:17:00.347
You were lucky.

00:17:00.459 --> 00:17:06.227
You would have been washed away
by the river if we hadn't passed by.

00:17:10.069 --> 00:17:11.798
Hey! It's that guy!

00:17:13.539 --> 00:17:14.471
Oh?

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:17.101
He's also regained consciousness...

00:17:19.812 --> 00:17:21.336
Hey, hey, you!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:25.407
Why the hell did you
suddenly attack me like that?!

00:17:27.519 --> 00:17:31.353
My, my. It's good that
you're full of energy, but...

00:17:33.058 --> 00:17:35.253
Anyway, you shouldn't ﬁght.

00:17:35.294 --> 00:17:38.354
We help each other as we travel.

00:17:38.731 --> 00:17:39.959
But this guy...

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:47.868
Hey! It's you!

00:18:00.185 --> 00:18:03.916
I can recover from
most of my wounds in a day.

00:18:04.323 --> 00:18:06.484
That's convenient...

00:18:06.525 --> 00:18:09.323
But that boy is also pretty impressive...

00:18:09.661 --> 00:18:12.824
He's healing as quickly as you are.

00:18:12.998 --> 00:18:14.727
Huh? Him, too?

00:18:21.039 --> 00:18:24.065
I'm so envious of youth...

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:41.887
Gramps, be careful.
He's really violent.

00:18:43.128 --> 00:18:47.588
Nerugui is shy,
but he doesn't bite people.

00:18:48.567 --> 00:18:50.330
Do you know him?

00:18:50.369 --> 00:18:56.330
Well, he's never left
the caravan until now.

00:18:56.542 --> 00:19:00.273
Aren't you glad that
you got back safely, Nerugui?

00:19:01.814 --> 00:19:04.180
He's our treasure.

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:09.578
l was the one who hired
the Leaf Village to search for him.

00:19:09.788 --> 00:19:11.949
I see. So it was you...

00:19:12.558 --> 00:19:15.425
We move all year,

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:19.453
so we wanted him delivered
to a village at the border.

00:19:19.498 --> 00:19:21.830
How'd he turn up here again?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.562
Well, that's because he suddenly...

00:19:27.639 --> 00:19:29.971
Hey, Nerugui!

00:19:34.847 --> 00:19:38.010
Is he really shy?

00:19:38.984 --> 00:19:41.043
So I thought...

00:19:48.427 --> 00:19:51.123
This area is crawling with those guys.

00:19:51.163 --> 00:19:52.152
Yeah.

00:19:52.231 --> 00:19:54.563
Who in the world are they?

00:19:55.267 --> 00:20:00.705
Who knows?
Sakura, keep looking for Naruto.

00:20:00.973 --> 00:20:02.668
If you find him,
inform me by intercom.

00:20:03.008 --> 00:20:04.771
Right! What about you?

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.734
There's something that l have to do...

00:21:30.162 --> 00:21:31.129
Come here...

00:22:16.041 --> 00:22:17.008
Master Haido...

00:22:22.848 --> 00:22:24.315
Say, say, say, say!

00:22:24.916 --> 00:22:28.113
Has this caravan always
been traveling?

00:22:28.887 --> 00:22:33.517
That's right. We've been on the road
ever since our country was destroyed.

00:22:33.925 --> 00:22:35.790
Ever since your country
was destroyed?

00:22:37.229 --> 00:22:39.891
It's a legend that has been passed down
by our clan from long ago.

00:22:40.532 --> 00:22:44.298
It says that we had a country,
but it was destroyed.

00:22:44.536 --> 00:22:46.333
Hmm... Why?

00:22:46.571 --> 00:22:49.506
It seems that, long ago,
there was a great catastrophe.

00:22:50.108 --> 00:22:53.908
We lost our country
and our clan was scattered.

00:22:54.046 --> 00:22:56.674
We became wandering people...

00:22:56.782 --> 00:22:59.615
And it seems that some of us
crossed the sea.

00:23:01.286 --> 00:23:02.218
The sea?

00:23:02.254 --> 00:23:03.278
That's right.

00:23:03.321 --> 00:23:08.190
Nerugui is a ferret that
was kept at our ancestors' palace...

00:23:08.393 --> 00:23:12.921
He's living proof that
we had a country long ago.

00:23:13.932 --> 00:23:15.593
Gramps, you're kidding, right?

00:23:15.634 --> 00:23:18.797
Then that means that
he's lived for a really long time.

00:23:18.837 --> 00:23:21.738
Yes. He has lived for
a really long time.

00:23:22.574 --> 00:23:23.700
Huh?

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:28.275
Nerugui is even older than Grandpa.

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:30.607
That's ridiculous...

00:23:31.016 --> 00:23:33.246
Amazing, isn't it?

00:23:33.285 --> 00:23:36.550
We've taken care of him
through the generations.

00:23:37.956 --> 00:23:43.189
That's why Nerugui doesn't take
to anyone outside of our caravan...

00:23:55.373 --> 00:23:57.534
Or so I thought...

00:23:57.642 --> 00:23:59.371
Has he gone to him again?

00:23:59.878 --> 00:24:03.541
Nerugui, what's wrong with you?

00:24:16.528 --> 00:24:19.497
Hey, hey! Are you talking now?

00:24:22.067 --> 00:24:24.399
Why did you suddenly attack me?

00:24:26.371 --> 00:24:28.771
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:24:30.542 --> 00:24:32.942
What is your strange power?

00:24:33.178 --> 00:24:36.238
Huh? Power? You mean Chakra?

00:24:36.982 --> 00:24:38.074
Chakra?

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:45.112
Indeed, I don't sense any GeIeI...

00:24:45.924 --> 00:24:49.883
Hey, hey, answer my question.
Who the hell are you?

00:24:51.396 --> 00:24:52.920
I came to build a utopia.

00:24:53.265 --> 00:24:55.597
Uto... What's that?

00:24:55.867 --> 00:24:59.701
You have an interesting power.
Come with me.

00:25:00.005 --> 00:25:01.063
Huh?

00:25:01.606 --> 00:25:04.507
I don't understand what
you're talking about!

00:25:04.609 --> 00:25:05.667
Think about it.

00:25:06.244 --> 00:25:07.609
No way!

00:25:07.646 --> 00:25:10.012
Why do I have to go with you?!

00:25:10.081 --> 00:25:12.072
I'm asking you
why you attacked me!

00:25:12.117 --> 00:25:14.483
I'm going to tie you up
and take you to the Leaf Village--! Whoa!

00:25:14.519 --> 00:25:16.783
Wait! Where are you going?

00:25:30.702 --> 00:25:32.033
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:25:32.070 --> 00:25:33.332
Wait for me!

00:26:06.071 --> 00:26:06.799
Are they all right?

00:26:07.806 --> 00:26:08.704
Are they hurt?

00:26:10.742 --> 00:26:11.640
They're okay?

00:26:12.911 --> 00:26:13.639
They look all right.

00:26:13.678 --> 00:26:15.305
What are you doing?!

00:26:16.881 --> 00:26:18.508
Thank you very much.

00:26:31.529 --> 00:26:34.555
Now, I've repaid my debt
to these people.

00:26:56.321 --> 00:26:59.848
Geez. These guys just
keep on coming...

00:27:20.945 --> 00:27:22.503
It doesn't look like
they're conscious.

00:27:36.761 --> 00:27:39.628
How long am I going to
have to look after these guys?

00:27:39.764 --> 00:27:41.823
Oh my. It's not good
to be short-tempered.

00:27:43.468 --> 00:27:44.526
I know!

00:27:44.836 --> 00:27:49.330
We won't need them
once we find the Stone of Gelel...

00:27:50.408 --> 00:27:52.069
Just be a little more patient.

00:27:55.080 --> 00:27:57.139
Well, we need them right now.

00:28:32.550 --> 00:28:34.848
He ran away! That bastard!

00:28:35.153 --> 00:28:38.122
I won't let you get away...!

00:28:40.158 --> 00:28:42.490
This is horrible...

00:28:42.961 --> 00:28:45.156
Hey, what's wrong, Gramps?

00:28:45.563 --> 00:28:48.327
Nerugui isn't here, either.

00:28:48.366 --> 00:28:50.163
Does that mean that
he went with him?

00:28:50.435 --> 00:28:54.132
Yes... What was the point of spending
a large sum of money

00:28:54.172 --> 00:28:56.504
to hire the excellent Leaf Village?

00:28:57.542 --> 00:29:00.670
Wait a second!
I just completed your request.

00:29:00.712 --> 00:29:04.580
Be quiet. I told you to
deliver him to the next village.

00:29:04.916 --> 00:29:07.885
Furthermore, Nerugui isn't here!

00:29:07.919 --> 00:29:09.443
That's ridiculous...

00:29:11.122 --> 00:29:12.749
If I knew this would happen,

00:29:12.791 --> 00:29:16.784
I would have hired the even more
excellent Sand Village from the beginning.

00:29:17.061 --> 00:29:19.723
Aw man!
I get it already, believe it!

00:29:28.173 --> 00:29:29.197
Naruto. . .

00:29:32.243 --> 00:29:34.040
There are signs that
someone was here...

00:29:34.779 --> 00:29:35.939
Could it be ?

00:29:51.095 --> 00:29:52.824
I ﬁnally caught up to you.

00:29:54.499 --> 00:29:56.797
Hey, hey! Give me back that cat.

00:29:59.003 --> 00:30:00.231
Why you...

00:30:05.844 --> 00:30:07.709
Wh-What is this?

00:30:14.018 --> 00:30:15.679
Exactly who are you?

00:30:16.788 --> 00:30:17.914
My name is Temujin...

00:30:19.090 --> 00:30:21.285
Come! I'll introduce you
to Master Haido!

00:30:22.060 --> 00:30:23.789
Huh?! H-Hey...

00:30:23.828 --> 00:30:25.352
Hold on a minute!

00:30:27.765 --> 00:30:30.700
Say, who is this “Master Haido“?

00:30:31.569 --> 00:30:34.766
My lord and a person
with a wonderful belief.

00:30:35.507 --> 00:30:36.337
You'll understand when you meet him.

00:30:41.079 --> 00:30:44.708
Say, are you friends
with those strange guys?

00:30:45.583 --> 00:30:47.483
They're just faithful soldiers.

00:30:48.920 --> 00:30:50.251
My friends are...

00:31:24.722 --> 00:31:25.814
l have returned.

00:31:27.292 --> 00:31:28.850
Ah, Temujin.

00:31:29.460 --> 00:31:30.859
You're back.

00:31:41.372 --> 00:31:42.669
It's you, isn't it?

00:31:44.142 --> 00:31:49.079
Temujin informed me that
you have an interesting power.

00:31:49.948 --> 00:31:51.745
I shall show you right now.

00:31:53.384 --> 00:31:53.941
Wh a--?!

00:31:55.219 --> 00:31:56.049
What's this?!

00:31:56.588 --> 00:31:57.577
Now come on!

00:31:57.622 --> 00:32:00.716
No! Stop this unnecessary fighting.

00:32:01.292 --> 00:32:02.190
But...

00:32:02.360 --> 00:32:05.488
No, ﬁghting is not good.

00:32:14.572 --> 00:32:18.064
Naruto, we have journeyed
to create a utopia.

00:32:18.509 --> 00:32:20.704
What is a “utopia“?

00:32:21.279 --> 00:32:22.337
Well...

00:32:22.380 --> 00:32:24.905
Simply put, it is a world
where there are no wars

00:32:24.949 --> 00:32:28.680
and the weak aren't oppressed.

00:32:29.187 --> 00:32:31.087
A world without wars?

00:32:31.723 --> 00:32:34.283
Yes... Our homeland...

00:32:34.325 --> 00:32:37.692
is in a far-off continent with
continuous wars...

00:32:38.630 --> 00:32:43.124
Wars are always unsightly
and sorrowful.

00:32:43.167 --> 00:32:45.795
It brings misfortune to all people.

00:32:46.638 --> 00:32:50.904
Temujin here also lost
his homeland to war.

00:32:50.942 --> 00:32:52.910
Are you all alone?

00:32:53.811 --> 00:32:55.438
l have Master Haido.

00:32:56.347 --> 00:33:01.148
Temujin was left behind in
his war-tom village when he was young.

00:33:02.020 --> 00:33:03.783
I made a decision.

00:33:04.355 --> 00:33:06.846
I wanted to protect the weak...

00:33:07.692 --> 00:33:11.651
I wanted to create a world
where no one had to fight.

00:33:13.631 --> 00:33:16.998
That is utopia... My dream.

00:33:18.169 --> 00:33:19.295
For the sake of my dream,

00:33:19.337 --> 00:33:21.601
I've traveled the world
gathering comrades...

00:33:22.106 --> 00:33:25.598
It has taken time to get this far.

00:33:27.145 --> 00:33:31.479
Unfortunately, there were people who
became noble sacrifices along the way...

00:33:34.218 --> 00:33:37.449
Say, Naruto, won't you come with me?

00:33:38.289 --> 00:33:42.123
I want you to help me
make this world a better place.

00:33:42.293 --> 00:33:43.658
Hmm...

00:33:43.695 --> 00:33:48.291
I'd like to go,
but I've got to become Hokage.

00:33:48.566 --> 00:33:49.294
Hokage?

00:33:50.168 --> 00:33:52.636
The best Ninja in my village.

00:33:53.705 --> 00:33:54.637
I see...

00:33:57.875 --> 00:33:59.740
Well, I can't go with you,

00:33:59.777 --> 00:34:03.474
but I'll also try my best
to make everyone in my village happy!

00:34:03.581 --> 00:34:05.913
Then let's both give it our best.

00:34:07.051 --> 00:34:08.450
— Huh?
— Oh?

00:34:09.120 --> 00:34:10.417
What is that?

00:34:10.922 --> 00:34:12.116
I'm
v
e
W
s
o
rry

00:34:12.156 --> 00:34:15.216
He came along with me
from a caravan that I passed...

00:34:16.227 --> 00:34:17.194
From a caravan . . . ?

00:34:18.596 --> 00:34:19.654
I see.

00:34:24.869 --> 00:34:25.767
A caravan...?

00:34:26.504 --> 00:34:28.096
Master Haido! Bad news!

00:34:28.372 --> 00:34:29.361
What's wrong?

00:34:32.577 --> 00:34:33.737
Huh? The Land of Wind?

00:34:33.778 --> 00:34:34.745
I'll go!

00:34:34.812 --> 00:34:36.712
Hey! What happened?

00:34:42.220 --> 00:34:44.051
Oh well, Fugai...

00:34:44.088 --> 00:34:44.918
Yes!

00:34:45.256 --> 00:34:47.724
There's somewhere
I want you to go.

00:35:04.942 --> 00:35:06.739
What is this?

00:36:02.500 --> 00:36:03.296
Hey!

00:36:04.235 --> 00:36:05.793
What's the meaning of this?!

00:36:10.374 --> 00:36:10.999
Answer me—!

00:36:14.812 --> 00:36:15.608
Naruto!

00:36:15.847 --> 00:36:17.212
Why are you here?!

00:36:19.817 --> 00:36:21.284
You're from the Sand...

00:36:21.752 --> 00:36:22.844
Well, that's ﬁne.

00:36:23.187 --> 00:36:25.553
You may have thought
that you could sneak up on us,

00:36:25.590 --> 00:36:26.887
but don't underestimate

00:36:26.924 --> 00:36:29.392
the Five Great Nations' Ninjas
of the Hidden Sand.

00:36:29.493 --> 00:36:31.893
What in the world happened?!

00:36:32.763 --> 00:36:34.731
Don't you know anything?

00:36:35.399 --> 00:36:38.459
These people invaded
the Land of Wind out of nowhere.

00:36:38.502 --> 00:36:39.594
What?!

00:36:40.438 --> 00:36:43.703
We've had quite a few casualties
trying to stop them.

00:36:44.242 --> 00:36:47.336
There are villages that were
caught in the battle and destroyed.

00:36:48.312 --> 00:36:50.109
Hey! Is that true?!

00:36:51.716 --> 00:36:53.775
They are noble sacriﬁces
to accomplish our goal.

00:36:54.218 --> 00:36:58.552
You bastard! What you're saying
is different from what you're doing!

00:36:58.589 --> 00:37:01.786
Sorry for butting in,
but I'm going to take him out now.

00:37:01.826 --> 00:37:04.818
Don't interfere!
He's my opponent!

00:37:04.862 --> 00:37:05.624
What?!

00:37:09.033 --> 00:37:11.661
Those who interfere...
must be eliminated!

00:37:14.438 --> 00:37:15.837
Bring it on!

00:37:18.876 --> 00:37:22.141
You idiot,
what are you doing here?

00:37:22.947 --> 00:37:25.415
Your primary duty is to scout.

00:37:25.449 --> 00:37:27.110
This guy's a lookout.

00:37:27.418 --> 00:37:29.579
There's another unit waiting nearby.

00:37:30.054 --> 00:37:30.952
But...!

00:37:30.988 --> 00:37:32.853
Why are you getting worked up?

00:37:33.057 --> 00:37:35.548
We're leaving before
this becomes troublesome.

00:37:45.069 --> 00:37:46.297
You're not getting away!

00:37:46.404 --> 00:37:47.894
You're late as usual.

00:37:49.006 --> 00:37:51.167
Oh well, I'll play with them.

00:37:51.542 --> 00:37:53.669
Persistent ones make things
worse for themselves.

00:37:56.013 --> 00:37:59.039
You...what in the world
are you thinking?

00:37:59.617 --> 00:38:01.380
I already told you.

00:38:01.419 --> 00:38:06.789
Proportionate sacriﬁces must be made
in order to achieve a large goal.

00:38:06.891 --> 00:38:07.915
What?!

00:38:08.659 --> 00:38:10.650
Weren't they your friends?!

00:38:11.862 --> 00:38:12.920
They were.

00:38:13.397 --> 00:38:15.297
And, from the bottom of their hearts,

00:38:15.333 --> 00:38:17.528
they're giving their all for
our dream of a utopia.

00:38:17.668 --> 00:38:18.657
No way!

00:38:18.736 --> 00:38:21.466
What do you mean, “friends“?! How can
you say it with such indifference!

00:38:30.948 --> 00:38:32.540
You're good at dodging.

00:38:40.291 --> 00:38:44.091
If all you can do is make it dark,
you're not much of a showman.

00:38:52.870 --> 00:38:54.804
These are people who
rebelled against us.

00:38:54.839 --> 00:38:58.570
They are regretting their mistakes
as criminals in the Land of Death.

00:38:58.809 --> 00:39:01.300
She's. . .a Genjutsu-user. . .

00:39:01.479 --> 00:39:06.348
The power of time will make you
suffer in eternity.

00:39:17.528 --> 00:39:19.758
It'll be too late to cry to me afterwards.

00:39:20.064 --> 00:39:22.965
That's enough talk.
Bring it on now.

00:39:30.808 --> 00:39:33.072
Tornado Lightning!

00:39:53.297 --> 00:39:54.628
Sand Shower!

00:40:14.185 --> 00:40:16.949
What's wrong?
Entertain me more!

00:40:50.387 --> 00:40:51.911
Go on to the next world...

00:41:03.501 --> 00:41:05.935
Thunder Saber!

00:41:17.715 --> 00:41:18.943
That was easy...

00:41:28.225 --> 00:41:30.318
Sand Burial.

00:41:37.168 --> 00:41:38.658
It's useless to struggle...

00:41:54.618 --> 00:41:56.279
So that's how you fight...

00:41:59.256 --> 00:42:01.986
Geez. You're a difficult opponent.

00:42:13.804 --> 00:42:15.465
This isn't over yet.

00:42:15.639 --> 00:42:17.766
So you've got the ability
to increase your power

00:42:17.808 --> 00:42:19.708
by changing your physical body...

00:42:22.279 --> 00:42:23.678
That's right.

00:42:27.151 --> 00:42:28.914
This is over.

00:42:29.420 --> 00:42:30.512
Here I go!

00:42:34.091 --> 00:42:37.925
It's useless.
That won't work against this Plasma Ball!

00:42:38.662 --> 00:42:39.856
Take this!

00:42:50.841 --> 00:42:52.399
How pathetic.

00:42:54.812 --> 00:42:56.541
lgot him...

00:43:00.551 --> 00:43:02.815
Is this the first time
you've fought a Shinobi?

00:43:03.120 --> 00:43:03.984
Wh a--?

00:43:05.256 --> 00:43:06.814
You're still alive?!

00:43:10.995 --> 00:43:12.622
Sand Tsunami!

00:43:38.722 --> 00:43:42.590
Your sand doesn't work
against my electric attacks!

00:43:45.863 --> 00:43:47.797
If you have your electric attacks...

00:43:47.898 --> 00:43:50.162
You can't defeat me!

00:43:50.501 --> 00:43:51.593
Sand Lightning Rod.

00:44:08.819 --> 00:44:10.582
Giant Sand Burial!

00:44:25.636 --> 00:44:26.534
How terrible!

00:44:31.008 --> 00:44:32.635
So this is where you were.

00:44:36.080 --> 00:44:37.604
I'm not letting you get away.

00:44:38.148 --> 00:44:40.708
I told you that persistent ones
only make it worse for themselves.

00:44:45.456 --> 00:44:46.787
What's that?

00:44:49.026 --> 00:44:50.493
That's pretty dirty!

00:44:52.062 --> 00:44:54.189
Crap! Wait, you bitch!

00:44:59.570 --> 00:45:00.400
What's this?!

00:45:01.205 --> 00:45:02.570
Temujin, withdraw!

00:45:05.309 --> 00:45:06.640
I won't let you!

00:45:08.011 --> 00:45:09.740
I won't let you get away!

00:45:09.780 --> 00:45:11.247
Hey, you idiot! Let me go!

00:45:11.281 --> 00:45:13.772
I'm not going to!

00:45:15.085 --> 00:45:15.949
Huh?

00:45:17.154 --> 00:45:18.746
l...can't hold on...

00:45:18.789 --> 00:45:19.517
Huh?

00:45:20.557 --> 00:45:23.424
What are you doing here?!

00:45:24.094 --> 00:45:26.221
Crap!

00:45:40.677 --> 00:45:42.167
Where are the Gelel stones?!

00:45:42.579 --> 00:45:45.139
Come now,
I wouldn't know about that.

00:45:45.182 --> 00:45:46.706
Are you playing dumb?

00:45:53.090 --> 00:45:55.820
Wh-Wh at?

00:46:00.898 --> 00:46:02.559
Shadow Possession complete...

00:46:09.306 --> 00:46:10.796
Grandpa, are you all right?

00:46:13.110 --> 00:46:15.670
We saw a pretty flashy signal flare...

00:46:16.213 --> 00:46:17.145
New enemies?

00:46:17.481 --> 00:46:20.416
Whoa. Your henchmen won't come
even if you call them.

00:46:21.351 --> 00:46:24.149
They'rejust big and useless.

00:46:27.558 --> 00:46:28.582
Wh-Wh at?!

00:46:50.447 --> 00:46:52.642
What was that? A wolf?

00:46:54.751 --> 00:46:55.649
Get ahold of yourself.

00:46:57.454 --> 00:46:58.819
Thank you...

00:47:00.991 --> 00:47:02.288
Say, Gramps...

00:47:02.493 --> 00:47:04.825
What is this “Stone of Gelel“?

00:47:04.895 --> 00:47:06.192
Huh? Gelel?

00:47:08.832 --> 00:47:11.357
Well, it's none of our concern...

00:47:11.802 --> 00:47:16.205
l was just curious since I heard
the same term used in their stronghold.

00:47:16.340 --> 00:47:19.969
Then does that mean
that it's connected to their goal?

00:47:20.711 --> 00:47:22.872
Or it could be exactly
what they're after...

00:47:23.580 --> 00:47:27.277
Well, it doesn't matter
if you don't want to tell us.

00:47:28.552 --> 00:47:30.884
We've got to look for a friend...

00:47:31.922 --> 00:47:33.014
Let's go, Sakura!

00:47:34.191 --> 00:47:35.089
But...

00:47:41.198 --> 00:47:44.827
Wait! Are you friends of Naruto?

00:47:45.736 --> 00:47:48.330
Grandpa, do you know Naruto?

00:47:49.106 --> 00:47:51.700
Please, help me...

00:47:51.742 --> 00:47:55.109
At this rate,
something terrifying is going to happen...

00:47:55.679 --> 00:47:56.805
Something terrifying?

00:48:06.623 --> 00:48:08.022
What do you mean, “friends”?!

00:48:08.058 --> 00:48:09.582
What do you know about me?

00:48:12.963 --> 00:48:16.490
What'll we do, Temujin?
Everyone's dead...

00:48:17.568 --> 00:48:18.694
Don't cry...

00:48:19.336 --> 00:48:20.234
But...

00:48:21.838 --> 00:48:23.237
This is dreadful...

00:48:28.712 --> 00:48:31.772
You're the only survivors of this village.

00:48:34.217 --> 00:48:38.620
This sort of misfortune
wouldn't happen in utopia.

00:48:40.157 --> 00:48:41.249
Utopia?

00:48:42.392 --> 00:48:46.453
It is the war-free world
I am trying to create.

00:48:51.435 --> 00:48:52.402
Isn't it wonderful?

00:48:53.203 --> 00:48:56.138
If I can only gather
a lot of these Gelel Stones...

00:48:56.239 --> 00:49:00.505
I can rid this world of all wars...

00:49:01.645 --> 00:49:04.113
Unsightly and sorrowful wars...

00:49:10.320 --> 00:49:12.151
It's amazing that
you can adapt yourself

00:49:12.189 --> 00:49:13.747
to the Stones of Gelel.

00:49:14.458 --> 00:49:15.425
You think so?

00:49:15.626 --> 00:49:19.619
It is. Temujin, I'm proud of you.

00:49:20.430 --> 00:49:21.488
Thank you.

00:49:22.866 --> 00:49:24.663
I'm not like you.

00:49:24.701 --> 00:49:27.295
I only have power
when I go in here.

00:49:27.904 --> 00:49:31.931
But our hearts are one.
After all, we're friends.

00:49:34.177 --> 00:49:36.907
We mustn't let other villages
become like ours.

00:49:37.781 --> 00:49:38.975
Let’s give it our best...

00:49:39.349 --> 00:49:41.283
For our utopia...

00:49:49.393 --> 00:49:50.189
What's wrong?

00:49:51.662 --> 00:49:55.962
That caravan you stopped by
had information on the Gelel Stones!

00:49:56.366 --> 00:49:57.162
What?!

00:49:59.503 --> 00:50:01.562
So the lead got away...

00:50:02.773 --> 00:50:04.638
I had Temujin go after them.

00:50:05.509 --> 00:50:11.414
I see. There was never a time
he didn't live up to my expectations.

00:50:12.382 --> 00:50:14.907
That's because
Temujin has that power.

00:50:44.581 --> 00:50:46.549
Hey! We've been waiting for you.

00:50:49.119 --> 00:50:50.279
You bastard!

00:50:50.821 --> 00:50:53.119
Do you know what you did?!

00:50:53.523 --> 00:50:55.388
l have nothing to say to you...

00:50:55.492 --> 00:50:56.390
What?!

00:50:56.493 --> 00:50:58.427
Now hold on, Naruto...

00:50:58.829 --> 00:51:01.320
Let me talk to him for a bit.

00:51:02.499 --> 00:51:05.866
I didn't expect you to
have information on the stones...

00:51:06.103 --> 00:51:10.130
So, why do you want
the Stone of Gelel now?

00:51:10.540 --> 00:51:12.167
Because they're important.

00:51:12.375 --> 00:51:15.606
You don't know
the horror of those stones.

00:51:15.846 --> 00:51:19.145
We mustn't bring them back.

00:51:19.549 --> 00:51:21.278
Are you lecturing me?

00:51:26.490 --> 00:51:28.082
I thought so...

00:51:28.825 --> 00:51:29.883
What is that?

00:51:30.460 --> 00:51:35.329
This is a Crystal of Gelel,
the source of life energy.

00:51:35.799 --> 00:51:38.131
I know more about
the stones than anyone.

00:51:38.835 --> 00:51:41.326
I can see where
you got your recovery powers.

00:51:41.571 --> 00:51:43.937
Where did you get that stone?

00:51:44.141 --> 00:51:46.905
I received it from my lord,
Master Haido.

00:51:47.244 --> 00:51:51.146
I see...
Is the stone only thing you have?

00:51:52.249 --> 00:51:54.080
That's odd.

00:51:54.184 --> 00:51:57.745
If you're the descendant of
our clan members who crossed the sea,

00:51:57.854 --> 00:52:00.379
why don't you know that?

00:52:00.624 --> 00:52:02.922
Was the Book of Gelel lost?

00:52:03.860 --> 00:52:05.521
What in the world
are you talking about?

00:52:06.062 --> 00:52:10.522
From ages past, the only ones
who could fuse their physical bodies

00:52:10.567 --> 00:52:15.436
with the Gelel Stones were
the royal family of our clan...

00:52:15.672 --> 00:52:19.506
Naruto, I told you a little about it, didn't I?

00:52:19.810 --> 00:52:24.873
I told you that when we lost our country,
some of us crossed the sea.

00:52:25.415 --> 00:52:26.746
Come to think of it...

00:52:27.517 --> 00:52:28.609
According to legend,

00:52:28.652 --> 00:52:32.053
it was the royal family of
our clan who crossed the sea.

00:52:32.189 --> 00:52:33.383
They took with them

00:52:33.423 --> 00:52:36.722
the last Stone of Gelel
and the Book of Gelel.

00:52:37.661 --> 00:52:39.561
You said your name was Temujin, right?

00:52:41.264 --> 00:52:45.030
You haven't come.
You've returned!

00:52:45.669 --> 00:52:49.161
We are of the same clan.

00:52:49.773 --> 00:52:52.674
No one knows how
that stone was created.

00:52:52.709 --> 00:52:58.045
But it seems that, long ago,
the mysterious Mine was found.

00:52:58.415 --> 00:53:02.784
Our ancestors refined that stone,
crystallized it,

00:53:02.819 --> 00:53:05.788
and named the mineral “Gelel.“

00:53:06.189 --> 00:53:09.818
And we created an empire
on this continent

00:53:09.860 --> 00:53:12.556
that was founded on the Gelel Stones.

00:53:13.063 --> 00:53:18.592
We built wells that didn't dry,
livestock that grew overnight,

00:53:18.635 --> 00:53:21.263
trees that continuously bore fruit.

00:53:21.371 --> 00:53:26.274
And we even tried to find ways
to stop living things from aging.

00:53:26.543 --> 00:53:27.908
That's the first I heard of that.

00:53:28.378 --> 00:53:30.573
It was a long time ago.

00:53:31.348 --> 00:53:35.512
But often,
great power brings catastrophe.

00:53:36.152 --> 00:53:40.486
People fought and quarreled disgracefully
for the power of the Gelel Stones.

00:53:40.690 --> 00:53:45.992
In the end, war was waged
with the stones' power.

00:53:46.463 --> 00:53:54.734
Mountains and the earth split and,
ﬁnally, the battle obliterated the empire.

00:53:54.971 --> 00:53:55.995
That's horrible...

00:53:56.539 --> 00:54:00.475
Only a handful of young people survived.

00:54:01.177 --> 00:54:05.238
Our ancestors sealed the Stone of Gelel
mineral deep underground

00:54:05.282 --> 00:54:08.979
and vowed never to
revive the stones ever again.

00:54:09.419 --> 00:54:12.877
Why didn't you try to rid yourselves
of such a terrifying thing?

00:54:13.423 --> 00:54:17.792
Only the blood of the royal family
can destroy the stones.

00:54:17.994 --> 00:54:20.986
We've lost the royal family,

00:54:21.031 --> 00:54:25.468
so all we can do is watch over
the stones through the generations.

00:54:26.503 --> 00:54:32.464
The legends were supposed
to fade and be lost, but...

00:54:32.809 --> 00:54:36.336
Fade? Destroy? Never.

00:54:36.846 --> 00:54:38.780
Hearing that, I made up my mind.

00:54:39.316 --> 00:54:41.750
I'm going to get those stones,
no matter what.

00:54:42.218 --> 00:54:44.709
You bastard... Weren't you listening?!

00:54:45.455 --> 00:54:49.983
Power is only power.
What matters is who uses it.

00:54:50.660 --> 00:54:53.561
It's a power that is beyond
what humans can handle.

00:54:54.097 --> 00:54:56.156
You mustn't revive the stones!

00:54:56.666 --> 00:55:00.397
Whatever power it may be,
Master Haido will use it in the right way.

00:55:02.305 --> 00:55:05.069
Master Haido said,
“Wars only breed misfortune.

00:55:05.108 --> 00:55:11.638
“But wars can't be stopped
without someone standing at the top.“

00:55:13.049 --> 00:55:15.540
The truth of those words
deeply touched my heart.

00:55:17.854 --> 00:55:19.685
In the confusion of war,

00:55:19.723 --> 00:55:22.283
my village was attacked
by a gang of thieves.

00:55:23.760 --> 00:55:28.561
We survivors were orphaned and
Master Haido adopted us.

00:55:29.466 --> 00:55:33.732
I want to grant Master Haido
his wish to free the world of wars.

00:55:34.371 --> 00:55:36.339
My friends all think the same.

00:55:36.473 --> 00:55:38.907
No matter what the sacriﬁce...

00:55:39.309 --> 00:55:42.904
this is my dream and I need
the Stone of Gelel to achieve it!

00:55:47.951 --> 00:55:50.010
He was faking it
from the beginning...!

00:55:50.153 --> 00:55:51.051
You bastard...

00:55:51.688 --> 00:55:55.385
Now... Tell me where
the Mine of Gelel is.

00:55:55.925 --> 00:55:57.017
I refuse...

00:55:57.427 --> 00:55:58.621
Oh well.

00:56:01.831 --> 00:56:02.695
My eyes...!

00:56:10.206 --> 00:56:12.401
Crap! What was that?

00:56:12.742 --> 00:56:14.232
Quickly, let's go after him!

00:56:14.544 --> 00:56:18.537
Emina, where is the Gelel Stone Mine?

00:56:19.416 --> 00:56:22.715
Sorry. Only Grandpa knows where it is...

00:56:23.253 --> 00:56:25.653
If only we had a Ninja Hound...

00:56:29.993 --> 00:56:30.925
You...

00:57:13.503 --> 00:57:14.561
So this is it...

00:57:25.648 --> 00:57:28.242
Sorry for treating you roughly...

00:57:30.386 --> 00:57:31.546
Now, go!

00:58:18.101 --> 00:58:19.125
How is it?

00:58:19.536 --> 00:58:20.525
Everything is ready.

00:58:20.870 --> 00:58:21.632
Good.

00:58:22.472 --> 00:58:24.269
Then let's move out.

00:58:57.207 --> 00:59:00.301
Where's he running? I can't tell!

00:59:00.510 --> 00:59:02.501
Right now, he's our only hope!

00:59:04.981 --> 00:59:05.879
Is that an exit?!

00:59:10.987 --> 00:59:12.818
Naruto! Do something!

00:59:24.000 --> 00:59:24.864
That way!

00:59:35.578 --> 00:59:38.240
You should know. Show me the way!

00:59:39.015 --> 00:59:40.141
This way...

00:59:42.885 --> 00:59:43.544
Wait!

00:59:46.723 --> 00:59:48.190
Let go of Gramps!

00:59:49.459 --> 00:59:50.187
You're in the way!

01:00:01.404 --> 01:00:03.235
Wh-What is that?

01:00:15.051 --> 01:00:16.109
Master Haido...

01:00:16.686 --> 01:00:18.620
The Mine of Gelel is down here.

01:00:18.988 --> 01:00:20.285
Thank you, Temujin.

01:00:21.157 --> 01:00:22.624
I've put you through
so much trouble.

01:00:23.059 --> 01:00:25.823
Thanks to you,
our utopia is right before our eyes.

01:00:25.995 --> 01:00:26.791
Yes!

01:00:27.764 --> 01:00:29.994
Everyone, let us go.

01:00:30.300 --> 01:00:31.358
Hold on a second!

01:00:35.138 --> 01:00:39.074
Sorry, but I have some things
I want to ask you.

01:00:39.709 --> 01:00:40.767
Master Haido!

01:00:40.977 --> 01:00:43.002
It's all right, Kamira.

01:00:43.546 --> 01:00:51.612
Hmm... How troublesome.
Is this rude person your friend, Naruto?

01:00:53.556 --> 01:00:58.584
What are you doing?
We made a promise.

01:00:59.462 --> 01:01:03.330
That we would both try our best
to make a better world.

01:01:03.833 --> 01:01:07.098
I'm the one who wants
to know what you're doing!

01:01:07.637 --> 01:01:11.596
What do you plan to do
once you get the Stone of Gelel?

01:01:12.542 --> 01:01:15.841
What will I do?
I'm going to create a utopia.

01:01:16.446 --> 01:01:20.815
A world without wars
where the weak aren't oppressed.

01:01:21.217 --> 01:01:25.847
I wonder. You look like you're doing
the complete opposite of that.

01:01:26.422 --> 01:01:29.858
It is all in the name of true justice.

01:01:30.093 --> 01:01:33.494
Then why did you attack
a defenseless village and caravan?

01:01:33.830 --> 01:01:38.961
I had no choice.
We've made great sacriﬁces too.

01:01:39.035 --> 01:01:43.631
These are all noble sacriﬁces
to make a world without wars.

01:01:43.840 --> 01:01:45.000
Hey! Old man!

01:01:46.275 --> 01:01:49.244
What are those “noble sacriﬁces“?

01:01:53.282 --> 01:01:55.807
Do you sum them up
as “noble sacriﬁces“

01:01:55.918 --> 01:01:58.978
even if it's your friends
who have fallen?

01:01:59.622 --> 01:02:02.716
That's what it means
to accomplish something.

01:02:03.292 --> 01:02:06.591
You, too. Are you okay with
your friend being treated like that?!

01:02:08.097 --> 01:02:09.064
That's right.

01:02:09.098 --> 01:02:12.431
That's what everyone has decided,
including me.

01:02:13.436 --> 01:02:14.664
It can't be helped.

01:02:14.937 --> 01:02:20.170
As friends, we share the dream
of a peaceful utopia.

01:02:20.343 --> 01:02:22.334
Then you're no friend!

01:02:23.312 --> 01:02:24.574
Why?

01:02:24.914 --> 01:02:27.144
I don't know for sure...

01:02:27.817 --> 01:02:33.813
But, to me, a friend is someone
you should cherish more!

01:02:36.025 --> 01:02:38.516
l was always alone...

01:02:39.762 --> 01:02:43.220
But I made friends and
was no longer alone.

01:02:43.933 --> 01:02:46.060
That's why my dream
is to become a Hokage

01:02:46.102 --> 01:02:50.129
who protects everyone in my village,
where my friends are!

01:02:52.074 --> 01:02:55.407
Who is your utopia for?!

01:02:55.445 --> 01:02:58.380
Any dream that doesn't cherish friends
is good for nothing!

01:02:58.581 --> 01:03:01.243
|'|| crush it!

01:03:06.823 --> 01:03:07.585
Wh a--?!

01:03:08.090 --> 01:03:09.955
What are you doing?!

01:03:11.027 --> 01:03:14.656
That thing should be eliminated
from this world...

01:03:14.864 --> 01:03:16.559
Along with us!

01:03:18.634 --> 01:03:19.623
Gramps!

01:03:28.344 --> 01:03:30.073
Eliminate the stone?!

01:03:31.814 --> 01:03:33.372
There is no way...

01:03:37.286 --> 01:03:39.186
What does he know?!

01:03:52.134 --> 01:03:54.625
Hurry! We are going after them!

01:03:55.037 --> 01:03:56.868
Master Haido! To the stronghold!

01:03:57.073 --> 01:04:00.531
There's not enough time!
Bring the stronghold with you!

01:04:07.116 --> 01:04:07.912
Wait!

01:04:08.618 --> 01:04:12.520
I'll deal with you, boy!

01:04:16.926 --> 01:04:18.188
What nerve...!

01:04:18.561 --> 01:04:20.153
Naruto, go!

01:04:21.564 --> 01:04:22.588
Crap...

01:04:26.002 --> 01:04:27.697
Hold it!

01:04:48.591 --> 01:04:49.489
Where are we?

01:04:49.859 --> 01:04:53.090
According to legend,
this is the Chamber of Sealing.

01:04:54.230 --> 01:04:56.926
Everything is as the legend says.

01:04:57.199 --> 01:05:01.863
It's the ﬁrst time I've come here,
but it feels kind of familiar...

01:05:05.875 --> 01:05:10.642
These were written by our ancestors
when they sealed away this place.

01:05:10.680 --> 01:05:14.582
It tells of the terrible power
of the Gelel Stones.

01:05:15.184 --> 01:05:16.276
What's this?

01:05:16.986 --> 01:05:19.716
It seems to be a depiction of despair.

01:05:20.256 --> 01:05:25.489
The empire was probably obliterated,
just like in that picture...

01:05:25.962 --> 01:05:28.658
How promising! It would have been
meaningless if we came this far

01:05:28.698 --> 01:05:30.859
only to ﬁnd the power of Gelel
wasn't what we expected.

01:05:31.367 --> 01:05:34.165
Don't you think that this is terrifying?!

01:05:34.203 --> 01:05:35.830
This tremendous picture proves

01:05:35.871 --> 01:05:39.967
that this great power can
only breed destruction...

01:05:40.676 --> 01:05:43.440
People will ﬁght with or
without the power of Gelel.

01:05:44.213 --> 01:05:47.512
We just have to use it
in the right way.

01:05:48.818 --> 01:05:49.785
I see...

01:05:50.720 --> 01:05:54.781
The Stone of Gelel is further down,
but ourjourney...

01:05:54.957 --> 01:05:56.083
ends here!

01:05:58.794 --> 01:06:01.786
Little girl, you'll die if you interfere!

01:06:13.709 --> 01:06:18.339
Come on, what's wrong, boy?
Entertain me more!

01:06:19.382 --> 01:06:22.078
Where are the shadow techniques
you're good at?

01:06:24.186 --> 01:06:26.814
Crap! She keeps ﬂying around...

01:06:27.690 --> 01:06:30.318
What should I do? Think!

01:06:39.468 --> 01:06:40.492
How's that?!

01:06:41.637 --> 01:06:42.934
Little girl!

01:06:43.706 --> 01:06:46.539
l blinded her.
How is she chasing me?

01:06:47.410 --> 01:06:51.005
The smell of your blood
tells me where you are.

01:07:01.323 --> 01:07:02.984
It's useless to hide...

01:07:07.697 --> 01:07:09.665
Little girl... There you are!

01:07:10.833 --> 01:07:12.164
Farewell!

01:07:25.815 --> 01:07:28.648
Damn it! Little girl!

01:07:55.578 --> 01:07:57.569
You think that you've caught me?

01:07:57.747 --> 01:08:00.545
Whoa! You shouldn't move!

01:08:06.589 --> 01:08:09.080
Oh, an escape opening...

01:08:11.527 --> 01:08:13.017
Just kidding.

01:08:13.062 --> 01:08:16.327
Your shadow is waiting there, isn't it?

01:08:21.003 --> 01:08:23.062
So many holes.

01:08:23.239 --> 01:08:25.730
Your shadow can't reach me from here.

01:08:27.042 --> 01:08:28.066
Adios...

01:08:31.447 --> 01:08:33.506
Hey, let me out! Let me out!

01:08:37.620 --> 01:08:39.383
Secret Black Move Iron Maiden 2.

01:08:40.923 --> 01:08:43.391
lt'sjust as I planned, I suppose.

01:08:48.631 --> 01:08:49.791
You saved me.

01:08:50.266 --> 01:08:52.496
I had a score to settle with her.

01:08:54.537 --> 01:08:58.029
That aside, we can't move recklessly
with all these paper bombs around.

01:08:58.174 --> 01:09:02.042
Oh... Most of these are
just regular pieces of paper.

01:09:03.112 --> 01:09:03.976
Really?

01:09:07.783 --> 01:09:08.772
How foolish.

01:09:09.351 --> 01:09:11.649
Did you think that you could defeat me
with a surprise attack?

01:09:12.321 --> 01:09:14.881
It's probably impossible...

01:09:15.324 --> 01:09:18.657
But I've achieved my goal.

01:09:18.961 --> 01:09:19.620
What?

01:09:20.262 --> 01:09:23.163
Do you know what
the design on this floor is?

01:09:24.633 --> 01:09:30.435
It's an ancient Summoning Jutsu formula
to summon a certain something.

01:09:30.539 --> 01:09:31.767
What are you thinking?

01:09:34.143 --> 01:09:37.135
Now be destroyed with me!

01:09:45.421 --> 01:09:48.083
I don't know what
he was trying to do...

01:09:48.991 --> 01:09:50.549
But it seems that I made itjust in time.

01:09:51.227 --> 01:09:52.057
Master Haido...

01:09:53.662 --> 01:09:55.527
Are you all right, Temujin?

01:09:56.732 --> 01:09:58.632
Master Haido, that just now...

01:09:59.034 --> 01:09:59.728
Oh...

01:10:02.238 --> 01:10:04.229
It was thanks to this.

01:10:06.775 --> 01:10:09.608
That's...a Stone of Gelel!

01:10:11.780 --> 01:10:13.270
It's just like in the book.

01:10:14.049 --> 01:10:15.346
What amazing power.

01:10:15.384 --> 01:10:17.477
I can blow things away
without touching them.

01:10:18.754 --> 01:10:21.882
Do you mean the Book of Gelel?!

01:10:22.224 --> 01:10:23.122
Excuse me?

01:10:23.626 --> 01:10:25.685
Where did you get that?!

01:10:25.928 --> 01:10:28.260
Oh, it’s not what you think...

01:10:28.297 --> 01:10:30.891
I bought it from
a wandering salesman.

01:10:31.634 --> 01:10:35.229
That's impossible!
I thought it was strange.

01:10:35.271 --> 01:10:39.071
You destroyed Temujin's village
to get the Stone of Gelel...

01:10:42.044 --> 01:10:44.979
Now why do you doubt me?

01:10:45.481 --> 01:10:48.541
My goal is a world without wars.

01:10:48.584 --> 01:10:50.677
How could you say
such a terrifying thing?

01:10:51.153 --> 01:10:55.783
Those who truly want peace
wouldn't want the power of Gelel!

01:10:55.891 --> 01:10:59.520
I want the power to stop all wars.

01:11:00.029 --> 01:11:01.792
That is all.

01:11:02.464 --> 01:11:05.592
Umm... The location of
the Mine is...

01:11:05.901 --> 01:11:09.701
I can tell by looking at your eyes!
You’re rotten at heart!

01:11:10.039 --> 01:11:13.634
Hmm... I don't really know where it is...

01:11:15.444 --> 01:11:17.139
Oh... What's this?

01:11:22.384 --> 01:11:26.047
This is...the key to open
the door to the Mine.

01:11:26.088 --> 01:11:29.455
Oh no! That's not for you!

01:11:32.861 --> 01:11:34.658
Nerugui!

01:11:38.701 --> 01:11:41.295
Oh...Nerugui...!

01:11:42.871 --> 01:11:46.967
Oh? There was a pebble of Gelel
in its mouth.

01:11:47.409 --> 01:11:51.436
The poor thing.
Another noble sacrifice.

01:11:52.014 --> 01:11:57.111
Honestly. Those who stand on top
have to make such tough decisions.

01:11:57.519 --> 01:11:59.578
I've had enough of your empty words!

01:11:59.822 --> 01:12:02.222
Oh, how troublesome.

01:12:02.858 --> 01:12:05.986
There's going to be
another noble sacriﬁce...

01:12:11.400 --> 01:12:14.369
I can't control my power very well yet...

01:12:16.472 --> 01:12:17.803
Well, that's ﬁne...

01:12:23.545 --> 01:12:25.513
What are you doing, Temujin?

01:12:26.515 --> 01:12:28.881
I'm very sorry, but...

01:12:29.385 --> 01:12:31.853
The Mine of Gelel is already ours.

01:12:32.287 --> 01:12:35.017
We can just ignore this helpless old man...

01:12:35.057 --> 01:12:37.389
That is not what I'm asking.

01:12:39.595 --> 01:12:41.893
Do not stand in front of my target.

01:12:48.070 --> 01:12:49.128
Master Haido?

01:12:50.105 --> 01:12:52.596
You're in the way there.

01:12:55.144 --> 01:12:56.941
What are you bastards doing?!

01:13:02.551 --> 01:13:04.644
Aren’t you persistent...

01:13:11.393 --> 01:13:12.485
Temujin!

01:13:12.528 --> 01:13:16.589
Why are you just standing there?
Kill them!

01:13:24.406 --> 01:13:25.236
What's this?

01:13:27.276 --> 01:13:30.609
ls this...a noble sacrifice?

01:13:31.447 --> 01:13:34.746
What's wrong?
Take care of them like you always do.

01:13:36.118 --> 01:13:37.278
Now, quickly!

01:13:38.821 --> 01:13:40.686
That's...enough, isn't it?

01:13:45.194 --> 01:13:48.095
Temujin, I'm disappointed in you.

01:13:49.431 --> 01:13:53.959
You're also an inferior person,
like your parents.

01:14:03.278 --> 01:14:05.769
— What a pitiful kid.
— What a pitiful kid.

01:14:08.217 --> 01:14:10.378
That's impossible... !

01:14:17.426 --> 01:14:19.758
That's right, it's me!

01:14:20.462 --> 01:14:23.363
I must say, you didn't even know
that I killed your parents...

01:14:23.398 --> 01:14:27.459
and you became so attached to me.
What a cute pawn.

01:14:28.337 --> 01:14:31.397
However...now that I know
where the stones are...

01:14:31.807 --> 01:14:34.139
I no longer need you!

01:14:44.786 --> 01:14:47.778
Master...Haido.

01:14:48.223 --> 01:14:50.453
Die, you good for nothing!

01:14:50.492 --> 01:14:51.925
Stop!

01:14:54.763 --> 01:14:55.730
Temujin!

01:15:00.435 --> 01:15:03.871
Now the world is mine!

01:15:10.479 --> 01:15:11.537
Temujin!

01:15:12.080 --> 01:15:13.274
Naruto...!

01:15:14.816 --> 01:15:18.047
Please, stop him... !

01:15:22.958 --> 01:15:24.084
You piece of trash...

01:15:35.204 --> 01:15:37.764
I won't let you go any further!

01:15:38.540 --> 01:15:40.872
First trash, now rubbish...

01:15:49.818 --> 01:15:51.183
Shadow Clone!

01:15:54.256 --> 01:15:55.553
l...

01:15:57.593 --> 01:15:59.151
We...

01:16:10.172 --> 01:16:11.537
Why in the world...

01:16:12.507 --> 01:16:14.134
have we...

01:16:22.584 --> 01:16:24.074
— Multi—!
— Too slow!

01:16:33.095 --> 01:16:35.859
Why don't you give up already?

01:16:36.665 --> 01:16:39.031
No...way...

01:16:52.481 --> 01:16:53.971
H-Hey you...

01:16:54.016 --> 01:16:57.782
Are you...going to give up here?!

01:16:58.053 --> 01:17:03.013
Wasn't your dream...
to make a utopia?!

01:17:09.665 --> 01:17:11.599
Rasengan!

01:17:26.581 --> 01:17:28.048
I did it...

01:17:30.185 --> 01:17:33.712
Where does he...get that strength?

01:17:49.504 --> 01:17:53.167
Well...that hurt a little bit.

01:17:54.176 --> 01:17:55.234
What?!

01:17:58.847 --> 01:17:59.836
This is...

01:18:03.852 --> 01:18:05.251
wonderful!

01:18:06.154 --> 01:18:07.985
It's the Mine of Gelel!

01:18:09.591 --> 01:18:11.991
My wounds are healing!

01:18:15.163 --> 01:18:17.097
What power!

01:18:19.801 --> 01:18:21.735
Temujin! Lend me a hand!

01:18:22.704 --> 01:18:24.797
I can't defeat him by myself!

01:18:25.607 --> 01:18:27.541
You...still...?

01:18:28.510 --> 01:18:32.674
I won't give up. Now, help me!

01:18:35.050 --> 01:18:37.712
What are you blabbing about?

01:18:38.587 --> 01:18:41.147
Go to utopia already.

01:18:44.926 --> 01:18:46.723
— Naruto!
— Temujin!

01:19:15.891 --> 01:19:17.256
Everyone...

01:19:17.659 --> 01:19:18.956
What...

01:19:20.228 --> 01:19:21.889
have I done?

01:19:26.334 --> 01:19:28.165
What foolish children.

01:19:28.804 --> 01:19:31.102
I thought I ordered them
not to interfere.

01:19:31.139 --> 01:19:32.834
Perhaps they're at a rebellious age.

01:19:33.809 --> 01:19:35.071
Well, no matter.

01:19:35.677 --> 01:19:37.770
This is beginning to bore me.

01:19:38.146 --> 01:19:39.078
Temujin!

01:19:50.192 --> 01:19:51.489
Damn it!

01:19:58.533 --> 01:20:00.000
Let’s go, Temujin!

01:20:19.020 --> 01:20:23.116
This is it. Go meet your ancestors!

01:20:26.895 --> 01:20:27.884
Temujin...

01:20:29.598 --> 01:20:32.294
Naruto...you were right.

01:20:32.734 --> 01:20:35.965
Dreams that sacriﬁce friends
should never come to fruition!

01:20:38.173 --> 01:20:40.300
Humph! Your deaths are long overdue.

01:20:48.550 --> 01:20:49.676
How impudent!

01:20:56.391 --> 01:20:59.121
You can't even touch me!

01:21:03.798 --> 01:21:05.993
Die already!

01:21:06.201 --> 01:21:07.361
Take this--!

01:21:11.806 --> 01:21:13.637
This is for Temujin!

01:21:14.242 --> 01:21:16.176
That won't work!

01:21:17.913 --> 01:21:19.642
Oh no!

01:22:09.864 --> 01:22:12.128
This is terrible?!

01:22:12.901 --> 01:22:17.939
The Mine of Gelel,
the source of life!

01:22:17.939 --> 01:22:21.067
Hey, Gramps!
What in the world is going on?!

01:22:21.910 --> 01:22:26.313
The seal was broken when
the key to the Mine was destroyed!

01:22:27.315 --> 01:22:28.748
What's happening?!

01:22:29.851 --> 01:22:33.343
The Mine of Gelel is going wild...

01:22:44.599 --> 01:22:45.361
How are they?

01:22:46.868 --> 01:22:47.994
They're breathing...

01:22:49.304 --> 01:22:50.828
But they're not regaining consciousness.

01:22:51.606 --> 01:22:52.538
I see...

01:22:56.878 --> 01:22:57.867
What's going on?!

01:22:58.279 --> 01:23:01.544
Damn it! I hope nothing troublesome
is happening.

01:23:07.322 --> 01:23:08.812
What happens when it goes wild?!

01:23:09.057 --> 01:23:13.221
I don't know! But considering
the scale of the ancient empire...

01:23:13.261 --> 01:23:16.594
it wouldn't be any wonder
if half this continent blew up!

01:23:16.631 --> 01:23:17.495
What?!

01:23:18.166 --> 01:23:19.428
How can we stop it?!

01:23:20.001 --> 01:23:23.232
Unfortunately, there is no way.

01:23:23.772 --> 01:23:26.935
What were you trying to do earlier?
You know some way.

01:23:27.676 --> 01:23:29.200
What was that Jutsu formula?!

01:23:30.378 --> 01:23:32.972
There isn't a way to stop it
from going out of control.

01:23:33.548 --> 01:23:36.813
But there is a way
to destroy the Mine.

01:23:36.951 --> 01:23:37.815
Tell me!

01:23:40.188 --> 01:23:42.986
This is a special
Summoning Jutsu formula!

01:23:43.158 --> 01:23:46.924
It is bound by royal blood.
Place your hand at the center!

01:23:47.128 --> 01:23:49.096
What are you going to summon?

01:23:49.597 --> 01:23:51.258
A Space-Time Rift.

01:23:51.399 --> 01:23:52.991
A Space-Time Rift?

01:23:53.635 --> 01:23:56.570
A vast empty space that
will swallow up everything.

01:23:56.671 --> 01:23:59.333
It will appear at the center
of the Jutsu formula.

01:23:59.407 --> 01:24:00.431
Therefore...

01:24:00.475 --> 01:24:04.809
The person who activates
the Jutsu won't come back alive.

01:24:06.981 --> 01:24:08.380
So that's it...

01:24:09.117 --> 01:24:11.244
Gramps! What do you mean
“won’t come back alive“?

01:24:14.189 --> 01:24:15.281
Naruto!

01:24:16.024 --> 01:24:18.288
This will be my way of
atoning for what I've done.

01:24:20.829 --> 01:24:21.921
You...!

01:24:22.464 --> 01:24:23.692
Take care of everyone!

01:24:49.991 --> 01:24:51.185
Temujin!

01:25:00.168 --> 01:25:01.226
How many more of them are there?

01:25:02.971 --> 01:25:04.199
Just a few more.

01:25:04.539 --> 01:25:05.563
All right.

01:25:07.108 --> 01:25:09.599
Crap! Come back safe, Naruto...

01:26:46.241 --> 01:26:47.367
No way...

01:27:21.576 --> 01:27:22.668
Come here...

01:27:24.712 --> 01:27:25.701
That's enough...

01:27:34.222 --> 01:27:36.281
Temujin, hold on tight!

01:27:36.958 --> 01:27:38.892
What are you, stupid?! You'll die!

01:27:39.260 --> 01:27:41.558
Shut up! Be quiet!

01:27:51.572 --> 01:27:53.563
That's enough. Let go!
You're going to get pulled in!

01:27:53.875 --> 01:27:57.470
It's not enough! It won't be
any good if you die like this!

01:27:58.646 --> 01:28:02.309
I don't want to lose
any more friends!

